### 盘口深度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prices/market/depth?instId=BTC-USDT&depth=20

### 最近公共成交
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prices/market/trades?instId=BTC-USDT&limit=20

### 前端 WebSocket 订阅示例
# ws://localhost:8080/ws/price-market
# {"op":"subscribe","instId":"BTC-USDT","depth":20,"channels":["depth","trades"]}
